[0m[48;2;40;67;43m[39m+     5[0m:[39m[48;2;24;38;30m [38;2;235;203;139m**[38;2;235;203;139mCONCEDE (partially).[38;2;235;203;139m**[38;2;192;197;206m The contrarian is correct that the split created an asymmetry where [38;2;163;190;140m`[38;2;163;190;140m_translate_lxx()[38;2;163;190;140m`[38;2;192;197;206m exists in the OT generator but deuterocanonical books (IDs 67+) route to the NT generator which lacks it. This is a real design gap.[K
