[0m[48;2;40;67;43m[39m+     7[0m:[39m[48;2;24;38;30m [38;2;192;197;206mHowever, I [38;2;235;203;139m**[38;2;235;203;139mrebut the severity characterization[38;2;235;203;139m**[38;2;192;197;206m: the contrarian implies this is a functional regression or defect. Evidence shows it is not:[K
